## This fork

This is [pasu11/caja](https://github.com/pasu11/caja), a personal fork of
[caja](https://github.com/mate-desktop/caja). It is not the upstream project:
please report upstream bugs upstream.

The `fixes-1.29.1` branch is the upstream **v1.29.1** release plus three local
fixes; `master` is upstream `master` with the same three fixes merged in.

| Fix | Files touched |
| --- | --- |
| Rename (F2 / context menu) is no longer cancelled when the vertical scrollbar appears ([upstream #1444](https://github.com/mate-desktop/caja/issues/1444)) | `libcaja-private/caja-icon-container.c` |
| The status bar shows the recursive size and entry count of the selected folders | `libcaja-private/caja-file.[ch]`, `caja-file-private.h`, `caja-directory-async.c`, `src/file-manager/fm-directory-view.c`, `fm-properties-window.c` |
| The context menu is rebuilt for every popup, so entries are no longer clipped or hidden behind empty scroll rows | `src/file-manager/fm-directory-view.c` |

See [FIXES.md](FIXES.md) for the full description, known limits, build
instructions and how to regenerate the patches.

## Installation

### Ubuntu

```bash
sudo apt install caja
```

### Fedora

```bash
sudo dnf install caja
```

## Building

### Source

You'll need the following dependencies:

  * `exempi`
  * `gobject-introspection`
  * `libnotify`
  * `libexif`
  * `gvfs`
  * `mate-common`
  * `mate-desktop`

### Building

```bash
git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/mate-desktop/caja.git
cd caja
./autogen.sh --prefix=/usr
make
make install
```

## Hacking on Caja

Please see the HACKING file for information about hacking on caja.

## How to report bugs / errors in translations

Bugs should be reported in GitHub

https://github.com/mate-desktop/caja/issues

We are using transifex for translations. https://www.transifex.com/mate/MATE/dashboard/

Please create an account, become a member of your language team and fix it there.

